# Routine "Weekly search report": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Monday morning, what moved in Search Console last week, why, and the two to four things worth doing about it.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/seo-aeo-desk && pi -p "/weekly-search-report"
